    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978470/extras/16d9550f1236a774bffe3448805177d1.avif?t=1732192870\" width=620 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you open this dreamy magic book, you will follow our steps and explore the endless fantasy world! As a curious beginner, you need to constantly improve your insight, find the mysteries of the world, and feel the flow of time and space. &quot;Where Wh..?&quot; is a puzzle-solving game with LowPoly art style, but this time, it takes you into a three-dimensional world and lets you embark on an adventure of searching and exploring. Here, you can enjoy beautiful pictures and listen to melodious music. This is a very suitable game to play alone. Of course, if family and friends join in, the journey will become more interesting! The game has nearly a hundred levels and more than 10 hours of game flow, which will definitely make you enjoy it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Such a beautiful world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978470/extras/c133b366e7e6e921501f90ad9390dbf5.poster.avif?t=1732192870\" width=620 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978470/extras/c133b366e7e6e921501f90ad9390dbf5.webm?t=1732192870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978470/extras/c133b366e7e6e921501f90ad9390dbf5.mp4?t=1732192870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a complete nine main world contents, each world presents a unique style and charm. From the sci-fi universe to the natural landscape, from the historical relics of humanities to the treasures of culture, every scene in the game is full of diversity and richness. We abandoned the monotonous and repetitive resource stacking, and instead focused on exquisite and reasonable design, perfectly integrating puzzles into the scene, allowing players to feel the charm and depth of the scene in the process of solving puzzles. At the same time, the background music that fits the atmosphere also adds more emotional color and immersion to the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classics and innovations coexist, returning to the essence of the game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978470/extras/73c057ef411aa13ad90ab7e198395d22.poster.avif?t=1732192870\" width=620 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978470/extras/73c057ef411aa13ad90ab7e198395d22.webm?t=1732192870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978470/extras/73c057ef411aa13ad90ab7e198395d22.mp4?t=1732192870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovations and breakthroughs have been made on the basis of traditional spot-difference games. It not only absorbs the advantages of a large number of similar works, but also brings a unique gaming experience by changing the viewing distance and distance. For the first time, the concept of time and space is incorporated, allowing players to feel the flow of time and the transformation of space in the game. A variety of shooting perspectives and transition methods also add more fun and challenges to the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Colorful journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978470/extras/849a6cb5ebf30b5436541d61b2c7be88.poster.avif?t=1732192870\" width=620 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978470/extras/849a6cb5ebf30b5436541d61b2c7be88.webm?t=1732192870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978470/extras/849a6cb5ebf30b5436541d61b2c7be88.mp4?t=1732192870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the game just repeats the same scenes and gameplay, it may make players feel that it lacks fun. However, &quot;Where Wh..?&quot; cleverly sets up a variety of different gameplays and scenes of various dimensions in the process, making the gaming experience more colorful. The smooth gaming experience, complete collection system, and various achievements hidden in the scene all bring endless fun to your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Comprehensive personalized settings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978470/extras/ed728c78830998f81d13ba54f07fb60a.poster.avif?t=1732192870\" width=620 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978470/extras/ed728c78830998f81d13ba54f07fb60a.webm?t=1732192870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978470/extras/ed728c78830998f81d13ba54f07fb60a.mp4?t=1732192870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to make players enjoy the game and feel comfortable, we have added many personalized options in the settings. You can open the settings at any time to adjust and find the most suitable gaming experience for yourself. Let me tell you secretly that turning on the window mode can further improve the gaming experience! The 2:1 widescreen picture makes the field of vision wider, making you feel as if you are in the world of the game and feel every wonderful moment immersively.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenge the boundaries of vision</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978470/extras/dff6c94144d5beaf90ea47a698d79ce0.poster.avif?t=1732192870\" width=620 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978470/extras/dff6c94144d5beaf90ea47a698d79ce0.webm?t=1732192870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978470/extras/dff6c94144d5beaf90ea47a698d79ce0.mp4?t=1732192870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to meet the players who are keen on deep puzzle solving and spot the difference challenges, we have specially set up &quot;Echo Mode&quot;. This mode is unlocked in the middle of the game, removes all prompts, introduces a new resource collection mechanism and a large number of updated scenes, and tests your observation skills in all aspects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978470/extras/1c588d9d322a8e1468abd148a9974a64.avif?t=1732192870\" width=620 height=230 /></span></p>",
