ture, every scene in the game is full of diversity and richness. We abandoned the monotonous and repetitive resource stacking, and instead focused on exquisite and reasonable design, perfectly integrating puzzles into the scene, allowing players to feel the charm and depth of the scene in the process of solving puzzles. At the same time, the background music that fits the atmosphere also adds more emotional color and immersion to the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classics and innovations coexist, returning to the essence of the game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978470/extras/73c057ef411aa13ad90ab7e198395d22.poster.avif?t=1732192870\" width=620 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978470/extras/73c057ef411aa13ad90ab7e198395d22.webm?t=1732192870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978470/extras/73c057ef411aa13ad90ab7e198395d22.mp4?t=1732192870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovations and breakthroughs have been made on the basis of traditional spot-difference games. It not only absorbs the advantages of a large number of similar works, but also brings a unique gaming experience by changing the viewing distance and distance. For the first time, the concept of time and space is incorporated, allowing players to feel the flow of time and the transformation of space in the game. A variety of shooting perspectives and transition methods also add more fun and challenges to the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Colorful journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app